{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27258","headline":"上太皇先生 · 章孝标","name":"上太皇先生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"颢气贯精神，苍崖老姓名。\n烟霞空送景，水木苦无情。\n斸药云根断，眠花石面平。\n折松开月色，决水放秋声。\n颜爲忘忧嫩，身缘绝粒轻。\n围棋看局势，对镜戮妖精。\n过海量鲸力，归天算鹤程。\n露凝锺乳冷，风定玉箫清。\n坐觉衣裳古，行疑羽翼生。\n应怜市朝客，开眼鏁浮荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27258.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27258","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}